The '''Rue Guardians''' are a mysterious order of [[Seekers]] from the [[Casterwill family]], who protect the family using ancient magic and curses. There are five Rue Guardians, with the [[Elder Rue Guardian]] serving as the leader of the other four.
== History ==
In ancient times, the Rue Guardians protected the [[Casterwill family]] with their curses. They created all kinds of dangerous Casterwill tests, including the Trial of Courage, the quest to find the [[Legendary Titan]] of Valour, [[Mythras]]. {{Source|Sophie on Trial}}

When the [[Blue Star]] was activated, the five Rue Guardians were among the representatives of the [[Casterwill family]] who met at the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. Their Elder, along with [[Focauld Casterwill]], opposed the presence of [[Lok Lambert]] for not being a member of the family and voted against open confrontation with the [[Blood Spiral]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

During the Blood Spiral's assault on the [[Fortress of Iron Will]], the Rue Guardians worked with [[Focauld Casterwill]] an ancient incantation, simultaneously invoking [[Coralgolem]], [[Feyone]], and [[Icarus]] Amulets within the stronghold. {{source|The Spiral War}}

On the longest night of the year, five Rue Guardians travelled in a [[Scramjet]] to the [[Spiral Mark]] with the rest of the Huntik Foundation and Casterwill alliance. {{Source|The Spiral Mark}} During the final battle against the [[Blood Spiral]], they used their powerful magic to take out numerous Spiral forces in the air, much to [[LeBlanche]]'s amazement. Following the defeat of [[the Betrayer]], the Rue Guardians were seen coming to celebrate with the rest of their family. {{Source|Dante's Return}}

==Personality==
The Rue Guardians are a mysterious and mostly silent order. Although sinister in appearance and description, the Guardians have the best interests of the Casterwill family at heart.{{source|Sophie on Trial}}

==Abilities==
The Rue Guardians hold the secret knowledge of the [[Fortress of Iron Will]] and the [[Amulets]] hidden within. Together, the Rue Guardians are capable of summoning an army of Titans to their aid and creating powerful magic in tandem. {{Source|The Spiral War}} In ancient times, the Rue Guardians created all kinds of dark incantations to protect the family's secrets, including the [[Fear Monster]]s of the Trial of Courage. {{Source|Sophie on Trial}}

